      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To begin the process, the inventory needs to be checked."
      ],
      "justification": "Initiates the process and captures the first action. The redundant 'start' node and explicit 'check inventory' node both faithfully preserve the opening behaviour."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Mac compares the inventory levels in the spreadsheet with the sales."
